          {
            "title": "Example: Correct answers",
            "id": 70687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kondisi untuk menyarankan restoran jika <code>diet</code> pengguna sama dengan <code>vegetarian</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" diet = \" /><text value=\"&quot;vegetarian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" veggieRestaurant = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Root&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" restaurant = \" /><text value=\"&quot;DelPosto&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (diet === \" /><text value=\"&quot;vegetarian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Try out: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(veggieRestaurant);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Try out: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Root\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>diet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan <code>diet</code> di kiri, periksa apakah nilainya sama dengan <code>\"vegetarian\"</code> untuk menyarankan restoran.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" diet = \" /><text value=\"&quot;vegetarian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" veggieRestaurant = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Root&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" restaurant = \" /><text value=\"&quot;DelPosto&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (diet === \" /><text value=\"&quot;vegetarian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Try out: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(veggieRestaurant);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Root&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"restaurant\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Try out: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Root\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>diet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"vegetarian\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Wrong answers",
            "id": 70688,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>!==</code> sebagai kondisi untuk menjalankan blok kode jika <code>today</code> bukan <code>Saturday</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" today = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sunday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (today !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saturday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Set alarm at 8:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"35\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Set alarm at 8:00\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>today !==</code>.</p></body></html>"
