            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>&gt;</code> untuk menulis kondisi yang memeriksa apakah <code>age</code> pengguna lebih besar dari <code>18</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" canDrive = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt; \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" canDrive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(canDrive);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"48\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>age &gt; 18</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Variables",
            "id": 70691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan perbandingan kesamaan antara <code>inboxFull</code> dan <code>true</code> di dalam <code>showAlert</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inboxFull = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showAlert = inboxFull === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (showAlert) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Your inbox is full.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't receive any more emails&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"inboxFull !== true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your inbox is full.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"You can't receive any more emails\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>inboxFull === true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu dapat menyimpan perbandingan dalam variabel dan menggunakan variabel tersebut sebagai kondisi.</p><p>Simpan perbandingan kesamaan antara <code>inboxFull</code> dan boolean <code>true</code> dalam <code>showAlert</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inboxFull = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showAlert = inboxFull === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (showAlert) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Your inbox is full.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't receive any more emails&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"showAlert\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your inbox is full.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"You can't receive any more emails\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>inboxFull</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>, dan terakhir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
